# Section headers (mandatory)

Every **section**, **panel**, **tool block**, and **page** in Queenswarm MUST follow this vertical order:

1. **Title** — section / tool / page name (`h1` page, `h2`/`h3` card)
2. **Description** — one line: what the operator can do here
3. **Inline hint `(i)`** — immediately after description text, vertically centered
4. **Content** — forms, tables, sub-nav, actions

## NEVER

- Put the hint in `actions`, top-right corner, or next to the title alone
- Wrap description + hint in `flex-wrap` / `inline-flex` (hint drops to new line)
- Ship a user-facing section without a hint (add to registry first)
- Use raw `InfoHint` without `hive-inline-hint` on section descriptions

## ALWAYS

| Layer | Component | Hint |
|-------|-----------|------|
| Page | `HivePageHeader` + `info={hivePageHintProps("…")}` | inline after subtitle |
| Card | `V4CardHeader` + `hint={sectionHintNode("…")}` | inline after `description` |
| Nested block in card | `HiveSubsectionHeader` + `hintKey` | inline after description |
| Integrations hub tab | `HiveSubnavRow` + `INTEGRATIONS_HUB_SECTIONS` | one sub-section per card (`?tab=hub&hubSection=`) |
| Registry | `frontend/lib/section-hints.ts` | title, description, options[], manualHref |

## Hint content

Each registry entry needs:

- **title** — matches section name
- **description** — 1–2 sentences explaining purpose
- **options** — 3–5 bullet strings (configuration, flows, guardrails)
- **manualHref** — deep link to `/manual#…` when section exists in manual

## Form fields (exception)

Label-adjacent hints on individual inputs (slug, auth type) are OK — that is **field** help, not **section** help. Section header still required above the form block.

## Code examples

```tsx
// Page
<HivePageHeader title="Swarms" subtitle="Colony control plane…" info={hivePageHintProps("swarms")} />

// Card
<V4CardHeader
  title="Swarm Fleet"
  description="Always-on routines — pause/resume without losing bees."
  hint={sectionHintNode("fleet")}
  actions={<HiveRefreshButton busy={loading} onClick={() => void load()} />}
/>

// Nested tool inside card
<HiveSubsectionHeader
  tone="cyan"
  title="Link Drop"
  description="URL → structured brief (read-only fetch)."
  hintKey="icmLinkDrop"
/>
```

## New sections checklist

1. Add entry to `SECTION_HINTS` in `lib/section-hints.ts`
2. Wire `hint` / `hintKey` / `info` on the header component
3. Keep real action buttons in `actions` only — never the hint
4. Use `HiveRefreshButton` from `@/components/hive/hive-refresh-button` for all **data refresh** actions (icon + label, `busy` while loading)
